**From visible code (loop-multi-agent.sh, loop-quality.sh)**:
- Module guards present (`if [[ $VERSION == "0.1.0" ]]; then`)
- Consistent bash 3.2 patterns (no associative arrays)
- Function signatures match expected patterns
- No obvious logic errors in extracted code

**Would require**: Direct inspection of all 6 modules to confirm quality across the full refactoring.

